      "text": "one way w/ css 🪄\n\nstack an image 2x\nfilter 1st, unclip 2nd on :hover 🤙\n\na img { grid-area: 1 / 1; }\nimg:first-of-type { filter: grayscale(1) invert(1); }\nimg:last-of-type {\n  clip-path: circle(0); transition: clip-path;\n}\na:hover img:last-of-type { clip-path: circle(100%); } https://t.co/x3rAD0shsC",
